flowchart TD
    accTitle: GNA disclosure workflow
    accDescr: A private report is triaged, then the case is approved and a GCVE ID reserved. At release time, the operator publishes the GCVE record, links the advisory and discloses the case, then verifies the public pages and API.
    intake["Receive private report"] --> review["Triage and coordinate a fix"]
    review --> approve["Approve the case and agree on release time"]
    review --> reserve["Set up the yearly range and reserve a GCVE ID"]
    approve --> save["At release time: save the public GCVE record"]
    reserve --> save
    save --> disclose["Link the record and advisory and mark the case Disclosed"]
    disclose --> verify["Verify public pages and publication API"]
    class reserve muted
    class save,disclose accent
    class verify success
